<title>NEW ZEALAND: PARAPINE NAME CHANGE EFFECTIVE AUGUST 22.</title>
<headline>PARAPINE NAME CHANGE EFFECTIVE AUGUST 22.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parapine Timber New Zealand said on Friday the record date for its name change to Counterpoint Equities will be at 5 p.m. on August 22.</p>
<p>New share certificates in the new name will be sent to shareholders by August 29.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom +64 4 4714 272</p>
